# LXDE autostart for Jubilee Automation kiosk
#
# Deploy this file to:
#   /etc/xdg/lxsession/LXDE-pi/autostart   (system-wide, Raspberry Pi OS)
# or:
#   ~/.config/lxsession/LXDE-pi/autostart  (per-user)
#
# The install.sh script handles this automatically.

# Disable screen blanking via X11 power management
@xset s off
@xset -dpms
@xset s noblank

# Launch the kiosk browser once the desktop is ready
@/home/pi/jubilee-automation/deploy/kiosk.sh
